  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  CauchAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "CauchAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → x0v scv Xv « x0v 0 + scv 0 + Xv 0 + → x0 sc X « '0.5+2*UVAL(UBASE(ATAN((X-x0)/sc)))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag '1/(Ⓒπ*sc*(1+((X-x0)/sc)^2))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '0.5-2*UVAL(UBASE(ATAN((X-x0)/sc)))' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'Ⓒ?' →Num "μ" →Tag 'Ⓒ?' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE x0v scv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
